  📗
    The source of *length* bytes of the file at *path*, from *offset* on, for
    a body of known length (🌊🐇📬 with a length). The file is opened when the
    body is written and closed before that returns, so a response that is
    never sent opens nothing. Where the file has fewer bytes than were asked
    for, fewer are written, and the connection ends behind the response.
